0.075 0.106 0.18 rg
45. 759.8899999999999864 Td
(1.1 Purpose of the System) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.157 g
45. 745.8899999999999864 Td
(The National Scholarship Trust Portal \(PS78\) is an enterprise-grade academic grant management system engineered to automate,) Tj
T* (safeguard, and mathematically audit the allocation and disbursal of institutional, state, and corporate endowment scholarships. The) Tj
T* (software integrates Indian national digital public infrastructure \(DigiLocker, UIDAI Aadhaar, NPCI DBT Bridge\) with a) Tj
T* (cryptographic SHA-256 audit ledger to provide end-to-end transparency, zero leakage, and real-time fraud immunity.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.075 0.106 0.18 rg
45. 687.8899999999999864 Td
(1.2 The Problem Statement \(PS78\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.157 g
45. 673.8899999999999864 Td
(Traditional scholarship administration across Indian higher education institutions suffers from four critical systemic vulnerabilities:) Tj
T* (1. Document Forgery & Tampering: Widespread use of photoshopped income certificates, counterfeit caste attestation, and) Tj
T* (fabricated grade sheets that evade conventional manual verification.) Tj
T* (2. Intermediary Leakage & Disbursal Lag: Manual paper-based fund disbursements through institutional middlemen cause) Tj
T* (bureaucratic delays of 6 to 14 months and fund diversion.) Tj
T* (3. Quota Violations & Seat Opacity: Lack of real-time seat tracking leads to over-allocation or quota hoarding by ineligible) Tj
T* (candidates.) Tj
T* (4. Discretionary Injustice: Inconsistent eligibility scoring where students below mandatory CGPA thresholds are approved while) Tj
T* (deserving high-merit candidates are excluded.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.075 0.106 0.18 rg
45. 550.8899999999999864 Td
(1.3 High-Impact Value Proposition) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.157 g
45. 536.8899999999999864 Td
(PS78 addresses each failure mode through algorithmic immutability: Verhoeff Dihedral D5 check-digit algorithms block counterfeit) Tj
T* (Aadhaar cards at upload; OCR forensics compare certified income against statutory Tahsildar thresholds; automated NPCI) Tj
T* (Aadhaar-seeded account validation guarantees funds hit genuine student bank accounts in seconds; and hard-coded CGPA criteria) Tj
T* (immediately disallow ineligible applicants before submission.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10.5 Tf
